{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:19 2026-07-02 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:19 2026-07-02 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:19 2026-07-02 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/61e60bac1e42a42a441c587338ba041b/2026-07/4440.jpg\"/><p>今（2日）午1時許，永久封閉的觀塘裕民坊，一架挖泥機在工地工作期間，不慎挖爆地下水管，大量黃泥水湧出，淹浸裕民坊、同仁街及觀塘道迴旋處，因積水太深，汽車駛過時激起大片水花。</p><p></p><img alt=\"汽車在水中駛過。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/79b1e0103859a78f7e142211072d2154/2026-07/01_2_1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"汽車在水中駛過。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/92cf953c154b5316e8c82ddd5cb8e59c/2026-07/02_2_0.jpg\"/><img alt=\"汽車在水中駛過。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8719a8e2b727f9e3b9f2ebaa29af5a84/2026-07/03_1_1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"汽車在水中駛過。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/776c4baa4da83ffa4a9087dce1c285d2/2026-07/04_6_0.jpg\"/><img alt=\"挖泥機疑掘爆水管。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3cd2dc8d18a80037b93a4a5f5780a189/2026-07/05_1_0.jpg\"/><img alt=\"挖泥機疑掘爆水管。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44d3acf043620b93c7cb1709efc3b752/2026-07/06_0_1.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n<p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-02T06:39:02.002918+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}